機能超便利&nbsp;，完全不用再煩惱食、衣、行、住的問題</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><br><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(51, 102, 255);\"><strong>環境與住家都是你最佳的選擇</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><br><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 153, 0);\"><strong>附註事項:</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 153, 0);\"><strong>1.禁養寵物不得聚賭吸毒嗑藥一發現報警並以違約論處</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 153, 0);\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 153, 0);\"><strong>2.入住者需經當地管區查詢有無犯罪記錄並流動人口登記</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 153, 0);\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 153, 0);\"><strong>3.入住年齡</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 255, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>限滿18歲不得超過50歲</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 153, 0);\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 153, 0);\"><strong>4.以上限制敬請見諒!以上要求敬請合作謝謝您</strong></span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "XXX 蘆洲區長安街", "lat": "25.0871421", "lng": "121.4583822", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "永樂街站", "distance": 113, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約113公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "成功國小站", "distance": 120, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約120公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "長安街站", "distance": 131, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約131公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "I KISS Hair Salon", "distance": 1090, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1090公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "小巷亭", "distance": 60, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約60公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市蘆洲區成功國民小學", "distance": 193, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約193公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "蘆洲三民國中捷運站", "distance": 693, "distanceTxt": "距房屋